eassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Erika Aasen}{mailto:erika.aasen@yahoo.no}] [{Niklas Aasen Eliasson}{mailto:salkin.eliasson@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"LSP","address":"\u00d8sterdalsgata 1D, 0658 Oslo, Norge","details":"Stort rosa bygg. Inngang fra \u00d8sterdalsgata. 1. etg med LSP Beachflagg utenfor.","coordinates":{"latitude":59.910359,"longitude":10.789941}},"information":"Velkommen til hverdagskubing p\u00e5 LSP i Oslo.\r\nDette er et nytt arrangement i Oslo der ideen er \u00e5 arrangere mindre konkurranser p\u00e5 hverdagskvelder gjennom hele \u00e5ret. \r\nVi holder til i et lite lokale sentralt i Oslo der LSPkuberne pleier \u00e5 ha kubetreff. \r\nVi h\u00e5per \u00e5 n\u00e5 b\u00e5de erfarne og nye speedcubere i Oslo som har lyst til \u00e5 pr\u00f8ve seg p\u00e5 konkurranser lokalt. \r\nVi vil lage m\u00e5nedlige konkurranser fram til sommeren og se hvilket format som funker. \r\nM\u00e5let er \u00e5 starte Osloligaen til h\u00f8sten, der vi k\u00e5rer en vinner etter resultatene fra flere sm\u00e5 konkurranser gjennom h\u00f8sten og vinteren. \r\nKonkurransen er sponset av Nordicube.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"LSPHverdagskubingMai2023","name":"LSP Hverdagskubing Mai 2023","city":"Oslo","country":"NO","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333oh","444","555","666","777","clock","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Vidar Norstein Klungre}{mailto:vklungre@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Erika Aasen}{mailto:erika.aasen@yahoo.no}] [{Filip Nilsen}{mailto:filipok04@gmail.com}] [{Niklas Aasen Eliasson}{mailto:salkin.eliasson@gmail.com}] [{Stian Nystad \u00d8stli}{mailto:stian.nystad@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"LSP","address":"\u00d8sterdalsgata 1D, 0658 Oslo, Norge","details":"Stort rosa bygg. Inngang fra \u00d8sterdalsgata. 1. etg med LSP Beachflagg utenfor.","coordinates":{"latitude":59.910359,"longitude":10.789941}},"information":"Hjertelig velkommen til v\u00e5r andre hverdagskubing p\u00e5 LSP i Oslo.\r\nKveldens konkurranse har et veldig spesielt opplegg, der hver deltaker har 18 minutter i total l\u00f8sningstid til \u00e5 gjennomf\u00f8re alle sine l\u00f8sninger. Det er deltageren selv som p\u00e5 forh\u00e5nd velger hvilke grener man vil delta i og bruke sine 18 minutter p\u00e5. Konkurransen foreg\u00e5r mandag kveld og varer i tilsammen ca 4 timer og du kan delta i maks 5 grener.\r\n\r\nVi holder til i et lite lokale sentralt i Oslo der LSPkuberne pleier \u00e5 ha kubetreff. \r\nVi h\u00e5per at b\u00e5de erfarne og nye speedcubere i Oslo har lyst til \u00e5 pr\u00f8ve seg p\u00e5 konkurranser lokalt. \r\n\r\nVi vil lage m\u00e5nedlige konkurranser framover og se hvilket format som funker. \r\nM\u00e5let er \u00e5 starte Osloligaen til h\u00f8sten, der vi k\u00e5rer en vinner etter resultatene fra flere sm\u00e5 konkurranser gjennom h\u00f8sten og vinteren. \r\n\r\nLokalet er har minimalt med tilskuerplass, s\u00e5 det er fint hvis antall gjester er s\u00e5 lavt som mulig.\r\n\r\nKonkurransen er sponset av NORDICUBE og SLOAP.\r\n\r\n--------------------\r\nWelcome to the second edition of LSP Hverdagskubing in Oslo. This competitions has a very special format, where each competitor has a total of 18 minutes of solving time to complete all their solves. The competitor gets to choose which events to spend their time on. Note, that each competitor can choose a maximum of five (5) events to compete in. The competition, which this time takes place on a Monday, lasts only approx. 4 hours.\r\n\r\nPlease read through all the tabs on this page (especially \"Hverdagskubing\") so you don't miss any important information.\r\n\r\nWe are based in a small venue in the center of Oslo where the LSPcubers tend to have cube meetings.\r\nWe hope that both experienced and new speedcubers in Oslo want to join these local competitions.\r\n\r\nWe will create monthly competitions in the future and see which format works.\r\nThe aim is to start the Oslo League in the autumn, where we will choose a winner based on the results of several small competitions throughout the autumn and winter.\r\n\r\nThe venue has limited space for guests. Please bring as few guests as possible.\r\n\r\nThe competition is sponsored by NORDICUBE and SLOAP.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"LTCCubeFest2017","name":"LTC Cube Fest 2017","city":"Lima","country":"PE","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333oh","444","555","666","777","minx","pyram","skewb"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Jose Abanto Ortiz}{mailto:jortiz1@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":null,"venue":{"name":"Plaza Tec","address":"Garcilaso de la Vega 1354, Distrito de Lima 15001","details":"Sotano","coordinates":{"latitude":-12.057115,"longitude":-77.038316}},"information":"Competencia en Centro Historico de Lima","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"LTCKids2018","name":"LTC Kids 2018","city":"Lima","country":"PE","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333oh","444","555","minx","pyram","skewb"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Jose Abanto Ortiz}{mailto:jortiz1@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Christian Olaya}{mailto:chrisadan@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"Cyber Plaza","address":"Av Garcilazo de la Vega 1344","details":"Semi sotano, Cerca a la pileta ","coordinates":{"latitude":-12.056863,"longitude":-77.038269}},"information":"Competencia abierta a cualquier participante. Informaci\u00f3n detallada en las dem\u00e1s pesta\u00f1as.\r\n\r\nThe competition is open to all competitors. For more information see the tabs.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"LTMAbuDhabiOpen2020","name":"LTM Abu Dhabi Open 2020","city":"Abu Dhabi","country":"AE","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":true,"events":["222","333","333bf","333oh","444","555","666","clock","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Aysha J