,"information":"","externalWebsite":"http:\/\/jrca.cc\/main\/modules\/news\/article.php?storyid=32"},{"id":"MacroMonterrey2022","name":"Macro Monterrey 2022","city":"Monterrey","country":"MX","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333bf","333oh","clock","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Areli Rub\u00ed Gordillo Mart\u00ednez}{mailto:amartinez@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Elio Estrada Vald\u00e9z}{mailto:elioxdbs7@gmail.com}] [{Luis Armando Mart\u00ednez Leija}{mailto:luis.martinez04.u@gmail.com}] [{Melissa Elizabeth P\u00e9rez Morales}{mailto:melissa.perez1303@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"Museo Metropolitano de Monterrey","address":"Ignacio Zaragoza, Corregidora &, Centro, 64720 Monterrey, N.L.","details":"Planta baja, explanada principal","coordinates":{"latitude":25.666424,"longitude":-100.31097}},"information":"![](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/rails\/active_storage\/blobs\/redirect\/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb29qIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--3fd3ee04cc4342b100336569c99d7ef80ddb3f0e\/Logo%20Macro%20a%20color%20con%20fondo%20de%20cubos%20y%20letras%20blancas%20.png)\r\n# \u00a1BIENVENIDOS AL MACRO MONTERREY 2022!\r\nTorneo oficial que se realizar\u00e1 en el Museo Metropolitano de Monterrey, lugar emblem\u00e1tico de la capital regiomontana que tiene m\u00e1s de 100 a\u00f1os de existencia en los que tuvo varias funciones, como ser la sede del gobierno municipal, y siendo actualmente el hogar de resguardo de 300 piezas hist\u00f3ricas.\r\n\r\nAhora, pasa a ser el sitio oficial para esta competencia que es la segunda parte de la **Ruta Regia**.\r\n\r\nTe invitamos a formar parte de este torneo que se celebrar\u00e1 en el centro de la ciudad, que ser\u00e1 abierto a todos los participantes que deseen competir. Esperamos que puedas asistir.\r\n\r\n> Todos los competidores deben estar familiarizados con el [reglamento de la WCA](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/translations\/spanish-american\/#2a) al participar en esta competencia.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n# \u00a1WELCOME TO MACRO MONTERREY 2022!\r\nOfficial tournament that will take place at the Museo Metropolitano de Monterrey, an emblematic place in the capital of Nuevo Leon that has existed for more than 100 years in which it had many functions, such as being the place of the municipal government, and currently has 300 historical pieces.\r\n\r\nNow, it becomes the official place for this competition, which is the second part of the **Ruta Regia**.\r\n\r\nWe invite you to be part of this tournament that will be held in the center of the city, which is open to anyone. We hope you can attend.\r\n\r\n> All competitors should be familiar with the [WCA regulations](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/translations\/spanish-american\/#2a) \r\n\r\n","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"MactanSpeedcubingOpen2019","name":"Mactan Speedcubing Open 2019","city":"Lapu-Lapu, Cebu","country":"PH","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333oh","444","555","minx","pyram"],"wcaDelegate":"[{James Stephen Sarmiento Cubarol}{mailto:jamescubarol117@gmail.com}]","organiser":"[{Alyssa Belle Yu}{mailto:abty15@yahoo.com}] [{Kristian Gil Caragan}{mailto:kristiangil01@yahoo.com}] [{Race Malubay}{mailto:babebibobunetta@gmail.com}] [{Wayne Pi}{mailto:wayneppi123@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"[Island Central Mactan](http:\/\/www.islandcentral.ph\/)","address":"MEPZ Ecozone, Mactan, Lapu-Lapu City, 6015 Cebu","details":"Activity Center, Ground Floor","coordinates":{"latitude":10.326582,"longitude":123.975858}},"information":"Competitor or guardian must agree that the organizers, PCA and WCA shall not be liable for any personal injury, property damage or loss resulting from your participation of this event.\r\nPlease read the WCA rules and regulations.\r\nPlease check the Competitor Guide and Even