rganizador atrav\u00e9s do e-mail (lojagcubos@gmail.com) indicando o nome completo do participante;\r\n5. Aguardar at\u00e9 que o registro eletr\u00f4nico seja aceito. Caso n\u00e3o participe mesmo com o pagamento, n\u00e3o haver\u00e1 devolu\u00e7\u00e3o do dinheiro. N\u00e3o ser\u00e3o aceitas inscri\u00e7\u00f5es no dia da competi\u00e7\u00e3o;\r\n6. Em virtude do COVID-19, o local s\u00f3 ir\u00e1 comportar um n\u00famero m\u00e1ximo de 30 competidores e 30 convidados;\r\n7. Outras informa\u00e7\u00f5es adicionais verifique no site da WCA ou entre em contato com o organizador atrav\u00e9s do e-mail (lojagcubos@gmail.com), bem como o delegado por meio do e-mail (gsantos@worldcubeassociation.org).\r\n\r\n\r\nREGISTRATION\r\nThe participation in this competition requires the comprehension and acceptance of the following requirements:\r\n\r\n1. Take all precautions regarding COVID-19 and follow what will be indicated by the delegate and the organizer;\r\n2. Being familiar with the WCA rules, since this is an official competition;\r\n3. Carefully choosing the events. Keep the rounds format, cutoffs and limits in mind.\r\n4. Register through the WCA website, pay in advance and send proof to the organizer via email (lojagcubos@gmail.com) indicating the participant's full name;\r\n5. Wait for your registration to be approved online. In the case of not participating and having already paid the registration, no money will be returned. Registrations will not be accepted on the day of the competition;\r\n6. Due to COVID-19, the venue will only hold a maximum of 30 competitors and 30 guests\r\n7. For additional information, check the WCA website or contact the organizer via email, (lojagcubos@gmail.com), or the delegate via email (gsantos@worldcubeassociation.org).","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"ManausPlazaOpen2023","name":"Manaus Plaza Open 2023","city":"Manaus, Amazonas","country":"BR","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"