normal 3x3x3 Speedsolving Event. If you are looking for a competition with more regular events, please see either [NxN Minnesota 2022](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/NxNMinnesota2022) or [Side Events Minnesota 2022](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/SideEventsMinnesota2022).\r\n\r\nThis competition is NOT part of the series with [NxN Minnesota 2022](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/NxNMinnesota2022) and [Side Events Minnesota 2022](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/SideEventsMinnesota2022). Anybody competing in that series is eligible to compete in this competition as well. \r\n","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"MentalBreakdownNorway2019","name":"Mental Breakdown Norway 2019","city":"Kjeller","country":"NO","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333bf","333fm","333mbf","444bf","555bf"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Daniel Wallin}{mailto:dwallin@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Vidar Norstein Klungre}{mailto:vklungre@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Peter Andersson}{mailto:peterandersson@online.no}] [{Vidar Norstein Klungre}{mailto:vklungre@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"[Kjeller skole](https:\/\/www.skedsmo.kommune.no\/kjellerskole)","address":"Kunnskapsveien 15, 2007 Kjeller","details":"Enter the main entrance, then go right after the stairs to Samlingssalen.","coordinates":{"latitude":59.973938,"longitude":11.040778}},"information":"**English:**\r\nWelcome to Mental Breakdown Norway 2019\r\nThis competition focuses on the five most advanced events we have: FM, 3 blind, 4 blind, 5 blind and multi blind. This is the first time such a competition is held in Norway. It is open to anyone who wants to attend, but since the events are quite demanding, we do not expect many first timers. Note that we do not compete in normal 3x3 at this competition! Also note that we only allow 30 competitors.\r\n\r\n**Norwegian:**\r\nVelkommen til Mental Breakdown Norge 2019!\r\nDette er en WCA-konkurranse som fokuserer p\u00e5 de fem mest krevende eventene vi har: FM, 3-blind,4-blind, 5-blind og multiblind. Dette er den f\u00f8rste av sitt slag i Norge. Alle som \u00f8nsker \u00e5 delta er velkommen, men siden eventene er ganske krevende, s\u00e5 vi regner med at de fleste som kommer har deltatt p\u00e5 konkurranse f\u00f8r. Legg merke til at vi ikke konkurrerer i vanlig 3x3 i denne konkurransen! Legg ogs\u00e5 merke til at vi kun godtar opp til 30 deltakere.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"MentalBreakdownSingapore2022","name":"Mental Breakdown Singapore 2022","city":"Singapore","country":"SG","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333bf","333fm","333mbf","444bf","555bf"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Zhou Yichen (\u5468\u5955\u81e3)}{mailto:yzhou@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Marc Lim}{mailto:marc.yj.lim@gmail.com}] [{Theodore Chan}{mailto:cketheo816@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"Neptune Court Community Complex","address":"10 Marine Vista, Singapore 449034","details":"","coordinates":{"latitude":1.306494,"longitude":103.922012}},"information":"","externalWebsite":"https:\/\/sites.google.com\/s2020.ssts.edu.sg\/mental-breakdown-sg2022"},{"id":"MentalBreakdownSummer2018","name":"Mental Breakdown Summer 2018","city":"Tacoma, Washington","country":"US","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333bf","333fm","333ft","333mbf","444bf","555bf"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Matthew Dickman}{mailto:mdickman@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Matthew Dickman}{mailto:mdickman@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"University of Puget Sound","address":"1500 N Warner St. Tacoma, WA 98416","details":"McIntyre Room 107","coordinates":{"latitude":47.263096,"longitude":-122.481428}},"information":"Registration Fee:\r\nThere is a **$20** registration fee for the event, payable through the WCA Stripe payment system. Please note that even after payment, registrations need to be manually approved before appearing on the registration list, so you may still not be fully confirmed immediately after payment. Please keep an eye out for the e-mail saying you have been approved. Registration is on a first-come first-serve and the same will go for the waitlist once registration fills up. Please do not register unless you intend on competing as it will open up a spot for another competitor who does intend on competing.\r\n\r\n**We will only be accepting online payment at this competition. If you have any issues with this, please contact us!**\r\n\r\nThere is a **25 competitor limit** to the competition. Please register as soon as possible if you plan on coming! Registration closes at the end of the day on July 7th. We will grant refunds to those who let us know by July 7th, but no refunds are granted after that date.\r\n\r\nThis competition is recognized as an official World Cube Association competition. Therefore, all competitors should be familiar with the [WCA regulations](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/). If you are new to competing, you may want to look at [CubingUSA's Competitor Tutorial](https:\/\/www.cubingusa.com\/ctutorial.php).\r\n\r\nJoin the PNW Facebook group to hear about competitions in the Pacific Northwest before they are announced and keep in touch with cubers in the area!\r\n[![Image description](http:\/\/i.imgur.com\/8uf2SCt.png)](https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/159856602085\/)","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"MentalBreakdownUruguay2022","name":"Mental Breakdown Uruguay 2022","city":"Montevideo","country":"UY","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333fm","333mbf"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Gennaro Monetti}{mailto:gmonetti@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Manuel Malv\u00e1rez}{mailto:manumalvarez770@gmail.com}]","organiser":"[{Asociaci\u00f3n Uruguaya de Speedcubing}{mailto:aus-competitions@googlegroups.com}] [{Sebastiano Benato}{mailto:sebastianomre@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"[Instituto de Ense\u00f1anza de la Construcci\u00f3n - UTU-IEC](http:\/\/www.iec.edu.uy\/site\/)","address":"Arenal Grande 1604, 11200 Montevideo, Departamento de Montevideo","details":"Room \/ Sal\u00f3n 006","coordinates":{"latitude":-34.899575,"longitude":-56.174945}},"information":"![](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/rails\/active_storage\/blobs\/redirect\/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBcElrIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--4be3c11536038145829dbcba17ca15bdea04981e\/imagen.png)\r\n# \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddfe\r\nHay un l\u00edmite de 15 competidores para el registro.\r\n\r\n* Leer el [Reglamento de la WCA](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/) para evitar posibles inconvenientes.\r\n* Esta competencia est\u00e1 abierta a competidores de cualquier nacionalidad, cualquier edad y a nuevos competidores, sin importar sus tiempos de resoluci\u00f3n.\r\n* Se debe tener en cuenta que los competidores pueden ser descalificados en los casos que prev\u00e9 el Reglamento de la WCA. No se realizan reembolsos de ning\u00fan tipo por descalificaci\u00f3n, seg\u00fan el art\u00edculo [2l1](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#2l1).\r\n* Los competidores deben llevar sus propios puzzles.\r\n* Los competidores tienen que estar presentes y listos para competir cuando se los llama, de no ser as\u00ed, se penalizar\u00e1 al competidor con la descalificaci\u00f3n del evento (de la ronda, no de toda la competencia), de acuerdo con el art\u00edculo [2u](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#2u) del reglamento.\r\n* Es importante leer toda la informaci\u00f3n disponible en la p\u00e1gina de la competencia.\r\n\r\nAnte cualquier duda consultar al organizador o a los delegados de la WCA. \r\n\r\n# \ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7\r\nCompetitor limit: 15.\r\n\r\n* Read the [WCA Regulations](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/) to avoid any issue.\r\n* This competition is open to competitors of any nationality or age.\r\n* Note that competitors may be disqualified under the circumstances described in the WCA Regulations. A disqualified competitor is not eligible for the refund of any expenses due to participating in the competition, as per regulation [2l1](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#2l1).\r\n* Competitors must bring their own puzzles.\r\n* Competitors must be present and ready to compete when called, otherwise the competitor will be penalized with the disqualification of the event, in accordance with regulation [2u](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#2u) of the WCA Regulations.\r\n* It is important to read all the information available in the competition website.\r\n\r\nFeel free to contact the organizer or the WCA Delegates.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"MentalBreakdownWashington2019","name":"Mental Breakdown Washington 2019","city":"Tacoma, Washington","country":"US","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333bf","333fm","333mbf","444bf","555bf"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Matthew Dickman}{mailto:mdickman@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Matthew Dickman}{mailto:mdickman@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"[University of Puget Sound](https:\/\/www.pugetsound.edu)","address":"1500 N Warner Street Tacoma, WA 98416","details":"[Wyatt Hall 101](http:\/\/bit.ly\/2SHZdXL)","coordinates":{"latitude":47.261946,"longitude":-122.482658}},"information":"For more information on cubing in the Pacific Northwest, be sure to check out our website!\r\n[https:\/\/www.pnwcubing.com](https:\/\/www.pnwcubing.com)","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"Mentallinn2019","name":"Mentallinn 2019","city":"Tallinn","country":"EE","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333bf","333fm","333ft","333mbf","444bf","555bf"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Andreas Pung}{ma