ionality or age.\r\n* For safety reasons, guests won't be allowed inside the venue, unless a competitor requires a guest for any justified reason (e.g. minors). In that case, guests should remain outdoors.\r\n* Competition will be held in accordance with the [WCA Safety Policy](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/documents\/policies\/external\/Competition%20Safety.pdf). Please, remember that the WCA Delegate may disqualify any competitor that behaves in a way that is unsafe for other people's health inside the venue (see regulation [2k3](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#2k3)). A disqualified competitor is not eligible for the refund of any expenses due to participating in the competition (regulation [2l1](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#2l1)). Please read the WCA Safety Policy to avoid any issue.\r\n* Competitors must provide their own puzzles in accordance with 2.6 of the [WCA Safety Policy](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/documents\/policies\/external\/Competition%20Safety.pdf).\r\n* Competitors must be present and ready to compete when called, otherwise the competitor will be penalized with the disqualification of the event, in accordance with the article [2u](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#2u) of the WCA Regulations.\r\n\r\n**Attention!**\r\n\r\n**The competition may be canceled by the WCA Board if the pandemic situation gets worse.**\r\n\r\nFor any question, feel free to contact the organizer or the WCA Delegate.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"MontevideoenLlamas2022","name":"Montevideo en Llamas 2022","city":"Montevideo","country":"UY","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","clock","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Gennaro Monetti}{mailto:gmonetti@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Manuel Malv\u00e1rez}{mailto:manumalvarez770@gmail.com}]","organiser":"[{Asociaci\u00f3n Uruguaya de Speedcubing}{mailto: